OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright start. Increasingly
OL,6,Fcloudy with some showery rain
OL,7,Farriving, perhaps heavy and thundery,
OL,8,Fwith strong winds for a time, mainly
OL,9,Faffecting coasts in the afternoon.
OL,10,FDuring the afternoon cloud breaking
OL,11,Fwith some sunshine returning and winds
OL,12,Feasing to light.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA clear night for much of the
OL,15,Fregion. Given light winds,
OL,16,Ftemperatures will fall, with a chilly
OL,17,Fend to the night, especially in rural
OL,18,Fareas. Some cloud affecting Derbyshire
OL,19,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
