OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely dry and settled on
OL,6,FThursday across the East Midlands,
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells developing after a
OL,8,Fchilly start. Light winds and good
OL,9,Fvisibility are expected, making for
OL,10,Fpleasant autumn weather.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMainly
OL,13,Fdry and settled on Friday but
OL,14,Fcloudier. Dry and brighter over the
OL,15,Fweekend with some sunny or clear
OL,16,Fspells. Temperatures near or rather
OL,17,Fabove normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
